{"question": "Find dy/dx when y = (2x + 1)^5", "groups": [{"id": "line1", "say": "We're given y equals two x plus one, all to the power five."}, {"id": "line2", "say": "Bracket to a power? Let u be the inside. So y is just u to the five."}, {"id": "line3", "say": "Differentiate each part. dy by du is five u to the power four. du by dx is two."}, {"id": "line4", "say": "Chain rule: multiply them. Then put the inside back."}, {"id": "answer", "say": "So dy by dx is ten, times two x plus one, to the power four."}, {"id": "annot", "say": "That multiply step is the chain rule. Every time."}], "strokes": [{"group": "line1", "d": "M 80 112 Q 83 131 90 137 Q 94 138 100 113"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 100 113 Q 96 141 87 151 Q 83 154 79 151"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 122 120 Q 135 119 147 120"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 122 131 Q 134 132 147 131"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 174 106 Q 163 123 172 148"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 188 116 Q 195 106 204 112 Q 213 121 200 131 L 187 140 L 211 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 226 112 Q 235 123 245 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 245 112 Q 235 126 224 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 264 126 L 288 126"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 276 113 Q 277 126 276 139"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 306 117 L 316 110 L 316 139"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 307 140 L 325 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 336 106 Q 348 126 336 148"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 365 101 L 350 101 L 349 109 Q 362 106 365 112 Q 368 121 352 119"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 83 211 Q 91 205 88 218 Q 85 233 81 240 Q 79 252 90 249"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 98 240 Q 118 237 110 230 Q 99 225 97 239 Q 97 252 113 247"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 126 215 L 124 243 Q 124 254 133 247"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 116 229 L 136 228"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 160 222 L 160 240 Q 161 253 171 249 Q 181 245 181 222"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 181 223 L 182 250"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 202 232 Q 214 231 227 232"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 202 243 L 227 243